{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53357","headline":"杂句 六 · 庞藴","name":"杂句 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无事失却心，走向门前觅。\n借问旧知识，寂绝无踪迹。\n却归堂上审思看，改却衆生称心安。\n不能出外求知识，自向家中入湼盘。\n大丈夫，昔日有，今日无，家计破除尽，赎得一羣奴。\n奴婢有六人，一人有六口。\n六六三十六，常随我前後。\n我亦不拘伊，伊亦不敢走。\n若道菩提难，菩提亦不难。\n少欲知足毛头宽，远离财色神自安。\n分明了见三涂苦，世上名闻不相关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}